# secrets: never upload the real API key.
# .env stays ignored so a plain one is never added by accident. The dotenvx
# ENCRYPTED .env is added once with `git add -f .env` (see CLAUDE.md), after
# that git tracks it. tests/test_env.py fails if it ever holds a plain value.
.env
# the private key that unlocks .env: NEVER upload, keep in a password manager
.env.keys

